# The world is a build artifact, not source. It is ~3 MB and it changes on
# every rebuild, so committing it would add 3 MB to this repo's history each
# time the design repo ships a world — in a repo that is not FSV's. Fetch it
# instead: npm run world:sync -w @witness/fsv
public/world/*.html
# Room pages ship the same way, one folder down.
public/world/rooms/*.html
